      "output": "**Level 1 — Easy**\n```\n#########\n#......H#\n#.......#\n#..#....#\n#....#..#\n#.......#\n#.......#\n#O......#\n#########\n```\nSolution: **E,E** (2 moves). Coordinates are (row,col).\n1. E (k=1, right) → stops at (7,7)\n2. E (k=2, up) → rolls up column 7 and enters H at (1,7). Win.\n\n**Level 2 — Medium**\n```\n#########\n#.......#\n#..#....#\n#......##\n#.H.....#\n#...#...#\n#.......#\n#O......#\n#########\n```\nSolution: **E,E,E** (3 moves)\n1. E (k=1, right) → stops at (7,7)\n2. E (k=2, up) → stops at (4,7), below the wall at (3,7)\n3. E (k=3, left) → rolls along row 4 and enters H at (4,2). Win.\n\n**Level 3 — Hard** (dead-end pocket at (1,2))\n```\n#########\n#..#....#\n#.#.....#\n#.......#\n#.....#.#\n#...H...#\n#..#....#\n#O......#\n#########\n```\nSolution: **E,E,E,E** (4 moves)\n1. E (k=1, right) → stops at (7,7)\n2. E (k=2, up) → stops at (1,7)\n3. E (k=3, left) → stops at (1,4), beside the wall at (1,3)\n4. E (k=0, down) → rolls down column 4 and enters H at (5,4). Win.\n\nEach level is 9 strings of 9 characters with one O and one H. In every level, O sits directly above the bottom wall. All three solutions were replayed by hand.\n\nMinimum move counts were checked by a manual breadth-first search over (position, k) up to one move short of each target:\n- **Level 1:** no 1-move win. The reachable stops are (7,7) and (7,1).\n- **Level 2:** no win in 2 or fewer moves. The reachable stops are (7,7), (7,1), (4,7) and (1,1).\n- **Level 3:** no win in 3 or fewer moves. The reachable stops are (7,7), (7,1), (1,7), (1,1), (1,4) and (1,2). The pocket is reached by Q,Q,Q.\n\nUnverified: these search checks have not yet been run in the game code."
